# Factory development-session layer (WO-2026-10-21-1 item 4). Session handshake files the bind
# writes, the private tier (live DBs, keys — never in git), and SQLite sidecars.
_SYSTEM/_MEMORY/_ACTIVE_SESSION.json
_SYSTEM/_MEMORY/_SESSION_INTENT.json
_SYSTEM/_PRIVATE/
*-wal
*-shm
# Claude Code: track only the shared session config and the two Factory hooks; session state,
# local settings and worktrees stay out. git never descends into an excluded directory, so the
# directory is opened with `.claude/*` and the tracked files are re-included one by one.
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks/
.claude/hooks/*
!.claude/hooks/cw_scope_guard.py
!.claude/hooks/cc_mark_wrap.sh
!.claude/hooks/cc_session_banner.sh
